CONTEXT DanglingPurposeRole IN ENGLISH
-- A PURPOSE ROLE must refer to a role that maintains a rule or that an interface is meant for.

RELATION r[A*B]
RULE rTotal : I[A] |- r;r~
ROLE Admin MAINTAINS rTotal

PURPOSE ROLE Contentmanager
{+ This purpose refers to a role that does not occur in the script. +}

ENDCONTEXT
